I just took a server class and got a real good book out of the deal:

Windows NT Server Survival Guide
by Rick Sant'Angelo and Nadeem Chagtai
published by Sams Publishing, c 1996
ISBN 0-672-30860-6

It's a monster and it includes a CD.

Of course, you should not leave home without the NT 3.51 Resource Kit:

MicrosoftR Windows NT Resource Kit, Version 3.51 (5 vol.)
Author:   Microsoft Corporation
ISBN:    1-55615-926-9
Pages:   5 volumes
Disk:    One CD-ROM
Price:   $199.95 US
Notes:   Qualify for a 25% discount if you're a member of MSDN.

