Just a couple of notes on Aaron's reply:

Out of the box, NT Workstation will support dual processor systems.
(For more than two, the OEM must provide a HAL that specifically supports
 the extra processors.)
Out of the box, NT Server will support up to quad processor systems.

Because of the overhead of "server"-related management tasks which NT
Server runs, it is NOTICEABLY slower than NT Workstation on the same
machine, IMHO.

