From: Criss Laidlaw <claidlaw@gmpvt.com>
Subject: Re: FTP for Alpha NT

You can build a DCL command file under VMS with a series of FTP commands in
it. I use this to periodically get Internet mailing lists from MIT. The DCL
file can
be executed interactively or in batch.

Here's a sample DCL file:

$! DCL to retrieve latest list of mailing lists from rtfm.mit.edu
$! This list is currently updated every 20th of the month.
$ on error then exit
$ FTP :== $UCX$FTP/ULTRIX
$ ftp
connect rtfm.mit.edu
LOGIN anonymous
claidlaw@gmpvt.com
cd /pub/usenet-by-group/news.answers/mail/mailing-lists
get part01
get part02
get part03
get part04
get part05
get part06
get part07
get part08
get part09
get part10
get part11
get part12
get part13

