The InitiateSystemShutdown function initiates a shutdown and optional
restart of the specified computer. 
BOOL InitiateSystemShutdown(
    LPTSTR lpMachineName,	// address of name of computer to shut down  
    LPTSTR lpMessage,	// address of message to display in dialog box 
    DWORD dwTimeout,	// time to display dialog box 
    BOOL bForceAppsClosed,	// force applications with unsaved changes
flag 
    BOOL bRebootAfterShutdown 	// reboot flag 
   );

see your favorite Win32 documentation for the gory details.
