Alan,

In a standard multi-address IP connection, the router is generally assigned the 
xxx.xxx.xxx.1 address, making the first available address for server/client use 
xxx.xxx.xxx.2.

If that's the case for you, then the router would respond to all calls to xxx.xxx.xxx.1 and 
they would never reach the Commerce Server.

