You're not low on space.  However, the lpd creates a spool directory   
under your %windir% (e.g., D:\WINNT\SYSTEM32\SPOOL...) and as I recall,   
the spool directory needs "full control" permissions to everyone.  See   
http://www.microsoft.com/kb/bussys/winnt/q138593.htm for a detailed   
article on the problem.

