Check the permissions on the \winn35 directory, or whatever is your 
default system directory.   If you modified permissions on the spool 
directory, your users probably don't have permissions to store temporary 
spool files.   Open up the permissions in the spool directory to "change" 
permissions and grant it to either everyone or domain users depending on 
your domain config.  

