Subject: FTP to Alpha NT

Since no one responded to my last question about how to
        make the FTP transfer default to the owners' home directory,
        I went ahead and called DEC (our NT support), and here's the
        "trick":

        If you have a directory structure set up for all your users 
        (i.e., F:\USERS, then F:\USERS\SMITH, F:\USERS\JONES, etc.)
        then set the default file transfer area to the F:\USERS directory.
        Then each user who initiates a file transfer from, say, VMS,
        will automatically default to their own home directory
        (a subdirectory under \USERS).

        Pretty cool!

