Rich,

Arrgghh!  That's a benign error that comes from a bug in the clinear.sys
miniport driver.  It happens because clinear.sys looks for its device
first in ISA space, declares one found, then looks for it in EISA space,
finds "another" (the same one), and declares an address conflict.  This
benign, but vexing error will go away in V4.0.

