Upgrading the AlphaStation 200's processor is not readily done.  The
best avenue for upgrading your system is to see if you can get your
favorite supplier to take your AlphaStation system box in trade for a,
e.g., AlphaStation 255/300 basic building-block.  That way, you use your
existing memory, peripherals, and so on, while getting the advantages of
much improved performance.

Alternatively, you could purchase a basic system box from one of the
Alpha clone vendors.  Many of them are followers of this mailing list; I
suspect one might get in touch with you via e-mail.

