type: intersvr
On the other system, edit the Config.sys and add:
 DEVICE=3Dx:\MSDOS\INTERLNK.EXE  as the last line. =20
Reboot that system.  When it comes back up, get into Windows File =
Mangler.  You'll see additional drive letters [with the floppy drive =
icon] that are the mapped drives from the laptop.

